      "content": "To integrate AI into your workflow effectively, consider starting with automation of repetitive and(tasks that require minimal human input. This will allow you to test the waters and assess its impact before making further changes. Additionally, focus on augmenting human capabilities, rather than replacing them, by using AI for tasks like data analysis, scheduling, and decision-making. Omnichannel communication and transparent updates can also help to reduce resistance from employees.",
